      "writtenOn": "2022-02-11T17:50:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To land something like this it will also be necessary to allow the information to be set here as well, and then to serialize and deserialize it. The effect in Chrome would be that the printing process wouldn\u0027t set the palette (and it still won\u0027t on Windows or Mac at the moment, until palette support is added there or a SkFontMgr hint is also serialized, which is another thing on the todo list).",
      "revId": "88736c5aa3a705d561b690795ad8cb089f894daa",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
